oints, including surveys from Suffolk, Marist, Siena and the University of New Hampshire. Seven professional raters split between Solid Democratic and Likely Democratic ratings.\n\nPingree has out-raised Charles roughly two to one, and prediction markets price a Democratic win in the mid-nineties. Bennett could draw some moderate votes, though Maine's ranked-choice voting limits spoiler risk. Barring a late shift, the Democratic side enters the final stretch as a clear favorite to hold the Blaine House.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9757, "margin": 10.9}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.9716, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9705, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9685, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9649, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9585, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.96, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9621, "margin": 10.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.961, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9719, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9653, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9728, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9678, "margin": 10.5}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9699, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9727, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.971, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.977, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9808, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9762, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.9806, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.9811, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.9804, "margin": 12.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.9778, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.9744, "margin": 11.5}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.9654, "margin": 11.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.9741, "margin": 11.0}]}